  "description": "<p>The server currently disallows edit of METHODMAP, DSINPUTSPEC and WSDL datastreams of BMechs/BDefs.  Now that we have CMDA we longer need this safety precaution.</p>\n\n<p>Completion of this item:</p>\n\n<p>MUST remove from the SERVER the current constraint that these datastreams cannot be edited.  See the fedora.server.management package.</p>\n\n<p>SHOULD add a test to the TestAPIM suite that modifyDatastream requests to these special datastreams succeed.</p>",
